{"type":"thinking","text":"We need create SVG. Need think design. Task: \"Flat vector illustration of a small kitchen table, seen from the front. On the table: exactly three red apples, a blue mug with the word MONDAY printed on it, and a folded newspaper with a gray cat asleep on top. Morning sunlight comes from a window on the left. Warm, muted colors. No people. Save it as kitchen.svg.\"\n\nNeed comply exactly. Likely produce SVG at good aspect maybe 1200x900 or 1024x768. Need exactly three apples. Blue mug word MONDAY. Folded newspaper with gray cat asleep on top. Morning sunlight from left window. Warm muted colors. Front view small kitchen table. No people.\n\nNeed think composition and craft. Flat vector style, maybe use gradients? \"Flat vector\" can include subtle shading, no realism. Warm muted palette. We can use vector shapes. Need perhaps make an appealing scene: room interior with window on left, table centered, wall, floor. Small kitchen table front view. On table three red apples, blue mug, folded newspaper with cat curled asleep on top. Morning sunbeam from window across table, shadows to the right. Warm cream walls, muted sage, terracotta, dusty blue mug. Cat gray. Apples red with muted red. Newspaper off-white with line marks and fold. Exactly 3 apples. Need cat sleeping atop folded newspaper.\n\nImportant: no people. Could include kitchen elements like chair, plant? Keep focus, maybe simple background. Need no extra objects that could count? exactly three red apples—avoid red circles elsewhere. Mug word MONDAY visible. Front view. Use text perhaps font \"Georgia\" or sans bold condensed. Need make text legible. Need maybe transform/skew for mug curvature. Could use path.\n\nLet's design in 1200x900 canvas. Table centered maybe x=600, tabletop y=590. Front view means table, legs visible. Window left x=90..330 y=120..430, sunlight beams diagonally to table. Back wall warm cream with subtle arch or tiled wainscot? Keep composition strong.\n\nNeed en